8:29Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Hint: The Almagest is a 2nd Century CE text that solidified a certain model of the universe", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:48:42Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Copernicus?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:48:43Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Geocentric", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:48:50Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Euclid?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:48:51Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Copernicus?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:48:54Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Brahe?", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": false, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:48:57Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Wrong wire", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:49:02Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Galileo", "role": "attempt", "is_correct": true, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:49:04Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Kepler", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:49:16Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Galileo is correct", "role": "confirmation", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:49:27Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Great question", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:49:40Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "This book was discovered recently, a 16th century copy of the Almagest full of notes along the margin", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:49:53Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Was identified as Galileo’s handwriting", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:50:18Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "There are bible verses too", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:50:42Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "Evidently he studied the geocentric model at length before refuting it", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:52:52Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "Those epicycles aren't easy to understand at all", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:54:33Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "It’s unnecessarily complicated and unwieldy", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:54:49Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "But then again it’s with the bias of us knowing the heliocentric model to be true", "role": "elaboration", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-10T18:59:37Z", "username": "Pavan Pamidimarri", "text": "for almost 1,500 years, it was easier for people to imagine this crazy complicated system with the earth at its center, than just move the center to the sun. this shows us how profound our reference point biases can be", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]